# Roger works from Windows (core.autocrlf=true) and macOS. Without this, git
# relies on a content heuristic to decide what is binary, and a PDF that
# happens to look text-ish gets CRLF-mangled on checkout. Be explicit.

* text=auto

*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.fit   binary
*.tcx   binary

# Zwift workout files are XML -- text, but keep them LF everywhere so the
# Zwift machine and both dev machines see identical bytes.
*.zwo   text eol=lf
